WEBVTT

00:09:59.417 --> 00:10:04.559
"No, you do not get
to get swallowed up by this.

00:10:04.583 --> 00:10:06.351
You have to survive.

00:10:06.375 --> 00:10:09.018
You've got so much to live for.

00:10:09.042 --> 00:10:12.101
Choose life, not death.

00:10:12.125 --> 00:10:14.684
Don't lose what you have

00:10:14.708 --> 00:10:17.143
to what you have lost."

00:10:17.167 --> 00:10:19.601
In psychology,
we call this benefit finding.

00:10:19.625 --> 00:10:21.351
In my brave new world,

00:10:21.375 --> 00:10:25.059
it involved trying to find things
to be grateful for.

00:10:25.083 --> 00:10:26.809
At least our wee girl

00:10:26.833 --> 00:10:31.101
hadn't died of some terrible,
long, drawn-out illness.